### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect pending pod events for ErrImagePull and ImagePullBackOff. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Wrong image reference, missing pull credentials or registry/network failure.

### Fix
Correct image references and pull credentials for the affected workflow template.

### Verify
No new image-pull failures occur throughout the 15-minute window and pods start. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
